    "listing_url": "https://shopgoodwill.com/item/285134161",
    "images": [
      "https://shopgoodwillimages.azureedge.net/production/58/Items/2026-11-23/79d9fa3e-491f-4d05-949f-d8fdb6720e3akcgw_11231.jpg",
      "https://shopgoodwillimages.azureedge.net/production/58/Items/2026-11-23/0eb584ae-cbfb-419a-a322-d496f2362331kcgw_11232.jpg",
      "https://shopgoodwillimages.azureedge.net/production/58/Items/2026-11-23/bd9a8936-71b9-49ff-b26a-5bd0b7946a83kcgw_11233.jpg",
      "https://shopgoodwillimages.azureedge.net/production/58/Items/2026-11-23/6ce5cf5c-0912-43be-acf8-41f0bf27b12ckcgw_11234.jpg",
      "https://shopgoodwillimages.azureedge.net/production/58/Items/2026-11-23/fec93c4d-2554-4ac1-a820-1dbce2faee79kcgw_11235.jpg",
      "https://shopgoodwillimages.azureedge.net/production/58/Items/2026-11-23/71e2d6ac-bd4b-477b-a0e8-1268e956d86ekcgw_11236.jpg",
      "https://shopgoodwillimages.azureedge.net/production/58/Items/2026-11-23/95b265be-4185-4e29-949f-6c95f5c60b6bkcgw_11237.jpg"
    ],
    "description": "Mineral and Crystal Specimen Lot - 31 Pieces\nNatural Geological Specimens & Polished Stones\nA diverse 31-piece collection of natural mineral specimens, raw crystals, and carved polished stones. This varied assortment features notable geological varieties including amethyst, pyrite, black tourmaline, and a polished banded agate slice with an open geode center, ideal for collectors, study, or display.\nItems Included:\nBanded Agate Slice - Polished cross-section with hollow center, approx. 5.25 in wide\nAmethyst Cluster - Purple crystalline cluster on matrix\nPyrite Specimen - Metallic brass-colored cluster\nBlack Tourmaline (Schorl) - Striated columnar crystal\nBlue Kyanite - Bladed fibrous mineral specimen\nBlue Apatite - Raw teal mineral rough\nQuartz Specimens - Clear quartz, citrine rough, and pink rock salt/calcite\nNatural Pebble - Rounded river stone\nPolished Gemstone Eggs - 21 miniature carved stone eggs including howlite, sodalite, and quartz (approx. 0.75 to 1 in each)\nCondition:\nGood overall condition with noticeable wear consistent with age and handling. Raw specimens display natural crystalline fractures, matrix textures, and rough edges. Polished eggs show smooth glossy finishes with inherent natural inclusions.\nNOTE\n: Unless otherwise indicated, this is a\nUSED\n, donated item/lot. We take every effort to document the condition and visible cosmetic damages, though we are not subject matter experts and items may contain unseen flaws or imperfections, such as cracks, crazing, bowing or separation.\nIf you have any questions regarding an item,\nplease reach out to us before placing your bid\n. If applicable, any testing for power or functionality, servicing or cleaning will be mentioned within the listing. Please assume items are untested, unserviced and presented as pictured otherwise.\nJEWELRY\n: Gemstones have been tested with Presidium Gemstone Tester. Precious metals are tested with a Thermo Scientific Niton DXL. Testing results are included in our listings where applicable. Gold JSP solution & rare earth magnets may also be used in testing. Gemstones may be natural or lab created. We identify gemstones to the best of our ability and testing equipment, but\nwe cannot guarantee specific gemstones\nif they look or test similar to other stones. Sterling Silver items may have very slight or localized magnetic properties due to rhodium plating, non-silver components such as pins or springs in clasps, or dependent on the metal the silver was alloyed with. Watch condition and functionality will be documented when possible. Watches may otherwise not be running, have internal issues or need additional cleaning.\nPlease Note\n: Certain jewelry items and lots may experience tangling from the sorting and shipping process.\nAS-IS\n: Listings are sold\nAS-IS with no refunds for condition or functionality\n. This includes, but is not limited to all electronic listings, all card lots, all jewelry lots and grab bags.\nIf you have any questions regarding an item,\nplease reach out to us before placing your bid\n.\nCOMBINED SHIPPING\n: All Jewelry items can not be combined with other any other items, including other Jewelry items without contacting customer service before payment. We reserve the right to approve or deny combination of items for shipment at our discretion.",
